{"kind":"stack","id":"stk-sun-eyes","title":"Sun safety and protecting our eyes","theme":{"background":"#fff8e1","foreground":"#1b1b1b","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Sunlight"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Sunlight is light from the sun. It is very bright, and it can hurt your eyes if you look straight at the sun."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-q","content":"Which of these can damage your eyes if you look straight at it?"},{"type":"button","id":"c2-a","label":"The sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"A rainbow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c2-c","label":"A bright lamp at home","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"What is the best way to protect your eyes on a sunny day?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"Wear sunglasses that block UV light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"Look at the sun for a short time","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"Squint hard at the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-t","content":"UV light"},{"type":"text","id":"c4-e","content":"UV light is a type of light we cannot see. It comes from the sun and can harm our eyes and skin."},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Which of these is a safe way to watch a solar eclipse?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Use special eclipse glasses","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Look at it through ordinary sunglasses","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Look at it with the naked eye","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"It is a hot, bright day. Your friend wants to stare at the sun. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Tell your friend to look away and put on sunglasses","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Stare at the sun together to see what happens","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You keep your eyes safe, and you explain why. Well done for looking out for your friend."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Staring at the sun can hurt your eyes. Next time, pick a safer choice and tell a grown-up."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"What should you do if your eyes feel sore after looking at the sun?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Tell a grown-up and rest your eyes","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Keep looking to check it is still there","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Rub your eyes hard","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Which hat or item helps shade your eyes outdoors?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"A wide-brimmed hat","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"A woolly scarf","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"A pair of wellies","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-t","content":"You finished the sun safety quiz!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Great work. Always protect your eyes from the sun, and ask a grown-up if you are not sure."}],"actions":[]}}
